              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Solution"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Reduce the committed example to an empty placeholder and assert no key-shaped string remains in it."
